  [1mThe fork:[0m nothing in this codebase currently knows a user ID. [38;5;153mlogin()[39m is what establishes identity, so a userId passed
  [3min[0m has to come from somewhere upstream that doesn't exist here yet — the form handler would pass [38;5;153mundefined[39m on every
